sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web (TS)
  participant A as API (Rust)
  participant D as Postgres
  U->>W: Submit form
  W->>A: POST /api/items {name}
  A->>A: validate (non-empty name)
  alt invalid
    A-->>W: 422 {error}
  else valid
    A->>D: INSERT item
    D-->>A: id
    A-->>W: 201 {id, name}
  end
  W-->>U: Show result
